# Gros maillages de la ville (m_Bld_kerb/white_trim/facade/metal, m_OuterRing) : SUIVIS via Git LFS depuis le stage clean-clone
# (ValVertSetup.Build n'est pas rejouable de façon prouvée ; la scène les référence par GUID). Voir Docs/clean-clone.md.

# Unity Asset Store vendor content lives under /Assets/ThirdParty/** (ignored below). Legacy pre-step-6 roots stay ignored as a guard.
# Ultimate Nature Starter (Standard Unity Asset Store EULA) - never commit raw files
Assets/InnerverseInteractive/
Assets/InnerverseInteractive.meta
Assets/World/Prefabs/uns_*
# European Forests - Realistic Trees (MysticForge, Asset Store EULA) - local only
Assets/Realistic Tree/
Assets/Realistic Tree.meta
Assets/World/Prefabs/ef_*
Assets/Generated/snowtrees/
Assets/Generated/snow/shell_UNS_Bush_Leaves.png*
Assets/Generated/snow/shell_UNS_Spruce_Tree_Branch.png*

